```text
Customer submits order
        |
        v
     Received
        |
        v
     Confirmed
        |
        v
      Picking
        |
        v
 Out for Delivery
        |
        v
     Delivered
        |
        v
 Invoice Created
```

Cancellation can occur before confirmation:

```text
Received -> Cancelled
```

Staff rejection/cancellation may also occur according to business rules.

